{
  "about": "The narrated tour recorded by tools/record_tour.py. Each segment is a page or a title card; each beat is a sentence and what is done while it is spoken. {energy_now} and {self_sufficiency} are written from the live readings when the take starts. Record in daylight, when the solar and battery flows are moving. 'allow' lists the only device and action-group ids a --live take may command; 'preflight' is the state the house must be in before a --live take. 'prepare' runs before a --live take (allow-listed ids only), so the take starts from the same place every time.",
